<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.2 클린 코드의 세 가지 비결 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n론 제프리스가 정리한 클린 코드의 핵심:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1368 ;
    djr:text "\n1. **중복 줄이기** -- 같은 작업을 반복하면 아이디어를 제대로 표현하지 못한 증거다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1369 ;
    djr:text "2. **표현력 높이기** -- 의미 있는 이름, 단일 책임 메서드\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1370 ;
    djr:text "3. **초반부터 간단한 추상화 고려하기** -- 실제 구현을 감싸는 추상화\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.3 세 가지 가치 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n켄트 벡은 훌륭한 프로그래밍의 공통 가치를 다음과 같이 정의한다:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n- **커뮤니케이션** -- 코드를 쉽게 이해하고, 수정하고, 사용할 수 있는가\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- **단순성** -- 복잡도를 낮춰 빠르게 이해할 수 있는가 (단, 과도한 단순화는 커뮤니케이션을 저해)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1371 ;
    djr:text "- **유연성** -- 변경에 대응할 수 있는가 (유연성은 복잡도를 증가시키므로 필요한 경우에만)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s011-1.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.6 제1 기술적 명령: 복잡성 관리 [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s011-1.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s011-1.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1372 ;
    djr:text "\n고품질 코드는 읽는 사람에게 **일관된 추상화 수준**을 노출하며, 명확한 경계로 구분된다. 본질적 복잡성(essential complexity)은 최소화하고, 우발적 복잡성(accidental complexity)의 확산을 방지한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s011-1.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s011-1.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s013-2.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.1 의도를 분명히 밝혀라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s013-2.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s013-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1373 ;
    djr:text "\n변수, 함수, 클래스 이름은 존재 이유, 수행 기능, 사용 방법에 모두 답해야 한다.\n따로 주석이 필요하다면 의도를 분명히 드러내지 못했다는 뜻이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s013-2.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s013-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nd = 7  # 경과 일수\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nelapsed_days_since_creation = 7\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s014-2.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.2 그릇된 정보를 피하라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s014-2.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s014-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1374 ;
    djr:text "\n유사한 개념은 유사한 표기법을 사용하되, 실제와 다른 정보를 이름에 담지 마라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s014-2.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s014-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\naccount_list = {}  # 실제로는 dict인데 list라고 명명\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\naccounts = {}\naccount_map = {}\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s015-2.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.3 의미 있게 구분하라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s015-2.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s015-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1375 ;
    djr:text "\n불용어(Info, Data, a, the)를 사용하면 개념을 구분하지 못한 채 이름만 달리한 것이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s015-2.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s015-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass ProductInfo: ...\nclass ProductData: ...  # Info와 Data는 아무것도 구분하지 못한다\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass Product: ...\nclass ProductDetail: ...  # 구체적으로 무엇이 다른지 이름에 반영\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s016-2.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.4 검색하기 쉬운 이름과 변수 이름 길이 [CC] [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s016-2.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s016-2.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1376, djr:R-1377 ;
    djr:text "\n이름 길이는 **범위(scope) 크기에 비례**해야 한다. 넓은 범위에서 사용되는 변수일수록 긴 이름이 필요하고, 좁은 범위의 지역 변수는 짧아도 된다. **[CC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s016-2.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s016-2.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1378 ;
    djr:text "\n평균적인 가이드라인으로, 변수 이름의 최적 평균 길이는 **10-16자**(Gorla, Benander, Benander 연구), 루틴 이름은 **15-20자**를 참고한다. **[CodeC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s016-2.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s016-2.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nfor i in range(34):\n    s += t[i] * 4 / 5  # 4, 5, s, t가 무엇인지 알 수 없다\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nWORK_DAYS_PER_WEEK = 5\nfor task_index in range(number_of_tasks):\n    real_days = task_estimate[task_index] * real_days_per_ideal_day\n    weekly_sum += real_days / WORK_DAYS_PER_WEEK\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s017-2.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.5 한 개념에 한 단어를 사용하라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s017-2.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s017-2.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1379 ;
    djr:text "\n추상적인 개념 하나에 단어 하나를 선택해 고수한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s017-2.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s017-2.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass UserRepository:\n    def fetch_user(self): ...   # fetch\n\nclass OrderRepository:\n    def retrieve_order(self): ...  # retrieve -- 같은 개념에 다른 단어\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass UserRepository:\n    def get_user(self): ...\n\nclass OrderRepository:\n    def get_order(self): ...  # 통일된 용어 사용\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s018-2.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.6 클래스 이름은 명사, 메서드 이름은 동사 [CC] [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s018-2.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s018-2.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1380 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 클래스: 명사 또는 명사구\nclass Customer: ...\nclass AddressParser: ...\n\n# 메서드: 동사 또는 동사구\ndef post_payment(self): ...\ndef delete_page(self): ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s019-2.7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.7 의도 제시형 이름 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s019-2.7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s019-2.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1381 ;
    djr:text "\n메서드 이름에는 의도만 전달하고 구현 전략은 담지 마라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s019-2.7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s019-2.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef linear_search_customer(customer_id: str) -> Customer: ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef find_customer(customer_id: str) -> Customer: ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s020-2.8> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.8 역할 제시형 작명 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.8" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s020-2.8/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s020-2.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1382 ;
    djr:text "\n변수 이름은 연산에서의 역할을 반영하여 짓는다. 생명기간, 범위, 타입은 문맥에서 전달된다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s020-2.8/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s020-2.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ntemp_str_list = get_items()\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nresults = get_items()         # 컬렉터 역할\npending_count = len(queue)    # 카운터 역할\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s021-2.9> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.9 컬렉션은 복수형으로 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.9" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s021-2.9/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s021-2.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1383 ;
    djr:text "\n여러 데이터를 저장하는 변수는 복수형이어야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s021-2.9/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s021-2.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nmember = [user1, user2, user3]\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nmembers = [user1, user2, user3]\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s022-2.10> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.10 한정자(Qualifier) 배치: 핵심 개념을 앞에 [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.10" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s022-2.10/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s022-2.10> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1384 ;
    djr:text "\n핵심 개념을 접두어로, 한정자를 뒤에 배치한다. 관련 변수들이 그룹으로 인식되고, IDE 자동완성과 알파벳 정렬에서도 이점이 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s022-2.10/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s022-2.10> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 한정자가 앞에 ---\ntotal_revenue = ...\navg_revenue = ...\nmax_revenue = ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 핵심 의미를 앞에, 한정자를 뒤에 ---\nrevenue_total = ...\nrevenue_average = ...\nrevenue_max = ...\n# 핵심 개념(revenue)이 항상 앞에 있으므로 그룹으로 인식 가능\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s023-2.11> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.11 불리언 변수 명명과 사용 [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.11" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s023-2.11/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s023-2.11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1385 ;
    djr:text "\n불리언은 이름이 참/거짓을 드러내게 하고, 사용할 때도 `if flag == True`처럼 불리언 리터럴과 비교하지 말고 값 자체를 조건으로 쓴다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s023-2.11/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s023-2.11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: True/False가 불명확 ---\nstatus = True\nsource_file = True\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 이름 자체가 참/거짓을 암시 ---\nis_valid = True\nhas_permission = True\nsource_file_found = True\norder_complete = False\n\n# --- 나쁜 예: 부정형 이름 (이중 부정 발생) ---\nnot_found = True\nif not not_found:  # 혼란스럽다\n    ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 긍정형 이름 사용 ---\nfound = False\nif found:\n    ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s024-2.12> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.12 `num` 사용 회피 [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.12" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s024-2.12/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s024-2.12> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1386 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: num의 의미가 모호 ---\nnum_customers = 5       # 총 수? 인덱스?\ncustomer_num = 3        # 총 수? 인덱스?\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 명확한 이름 ---\ncustomer_count = 5      # 총 수\ncustomer_index = 3      # 인덱스\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s025-2.13> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.13 루프 변수 명명 [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.13" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s025-2.13/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s025-2.13> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1387 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 허용: 짧은 루프에서 관례적 이름\nfor i in range(10):\n    matrix[i] = 0\n\n# 좋은 예: 긴 루프나 중첩 루프에서는 의미 있는 이름\nfor team_index, team in enumerate(teams):\n    for player_index, player in enumerate(team.players):\n        scores[team_index][player_index] = player.score\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.14 매직 값과 상수 승격 판정 [PP] [Ref]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.14" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1388 ;
    djr:text "\n리터럴을 상수·Enum으로 승격할지는 \"문자열이냐\"가 아니라 **오타의 실패 모드**와 **철자의 계약성**으로 판정한다. 리터럴 오타는 조용한 항상-False로 잠복하고, 심볼 오타는 `AttributeError`로 즉사한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1404, djr:R-1405 ;
    djr:text "- 외부 프로토콜이 소유한 문자열(content type·vendor 코드·프로토콜 에러 코드) — 단 분기 조건이 되는 순간 경계(adapter)에서 내부 타입으로 정규화하고 원시 리터럴이 경계 밖으로 새지 않게 한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1406 ;
    djr:text "- 식별자형·구조 문자열(dict 키·kwargs·separator·설정 키·환경변수명)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s078-15.4/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1407, djr:R-1408 ;
    djr:text "- 테스트에서 외부 관찰 계약을 검증하는 **assert 기댓값** — 오히려 리터럴을 강제한다(프로덕션 상수 역수입은 자기참조 오라클; `implementation-test` §15.4). 테스트의 arrange/act(픽스처·필터 준비)는 심볼 권장 — 두 규율은 위치로 갈린다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1409, djr:R-1410, djr:R-1411, djr:R-1412 ;
    djr:text "\n**짝 규칙(소비 규율)**: 집합 타입이 선언된 값의 비교·분기·필터·대입·기본값은 반드시 그 심볼로 참조한다 — 선언하고 리터럴로 소비하면 위반이다. 비교는 `==`로 한다(`is` 금지 — 문자열 Enum 값은 경계에서 plain str로 흐르므로 `is`는 수화 누락 시 오타 없이도 조용한 False를 만든다). 단 심볼 치환은 판정 소유 규율을 면책하지 않는다: 도메인 어휘로 진술되는 복합 상태 판정의 1차 시정은 애그리거트 술어·enum 프로퍼티다(`architecture-ddd` §3.2). 값에 검증·연산·불변식이 붙으면(집합의 폐쇄성과 무관하게) Enum이 아니라 값 객체 승격 대상이다(판정은 `architecture-ddd` §3.1 소관).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1413, djr:R-1414 ;
    djr:text "\n**숫자 부칙**: 비교·계산에 등장하는 의미 있는 숫자는 1회부터 명명 상수(ruff/pylint magic-value-comparison과 대상 동일·더 강한 수위). `0`·`±1`·루프 인덱스·수식의 본질적 구성 숫자(근의 공식의 2·4)는 면제.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n**승격 판정 원리**:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1389, djr:R-1390, djr:R-1391, djr:R-1392, djr:R-1393 ;
    djr:text "\n1. 값들의 **닫힌 집합의 원소**이면서 **우리 코드가 그 값으로 분기·판정·필터**하거나 계약(wire·DB 제약)에 노출하면 **집합 단위 타입**으로 — 1곳째부터. 도메인 상태·종류(type code)가 여기다. 낱개 상수 나열(`DUPLICATE_REPLAY = \"duplicate_replay\"`)이 아니라 집합 하나의 타입으로 — \"이 상태가 전부인가\"를 한 곳에서 답한다. **과승격 방지**: 분기 없이 저장·중계만 하는 pass-through 값은 강제 대상이 아니고, 상류가 소유한 열린 집합은 분기에 쓰는 값만 멤버로 두되 미지 값 처리 방침(UNKNOWN 폴백 또는 명시 거부)을 함께 정한다. 이름이 type/kind라는 이유만으로 승격하지 않는다. 단 **우리 BC가 발행하는 이벤트 봉투의 discriminator는 1종째부터 enum**이다 — 예외가 아니라 판정의 선행 확정: 발행 봉투는 outbox 저장·wire 노출로 이 앵커에 구조적으로 도달하므로 판정을 확장 시점으로 미루지 않는다(birth-enum — `architecture-ddd` §3.7).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1394, djr:R-1395, djr:R-1396 ;
    djr:text "2. 닫힌 집합이 아니라도 **같은 지식의 철자를 서로 다른 파일 2곳 이상이 공유**하면 명명 상수로. 우연히 값이 같을 뿐 다른 지식이면 합치지 않는다(나이 상한 150과 층수 상한 150은 별개 — §13.1). 같은 파일 안 반복이 같은 지식이면 §13.1 지식-중복 판정이 우선한다 — 파일 임계는 승격 *강제* 시점일 뿐 DRY를 완화하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1397 ;
    djr:text "3. 나머지는 리터럴 그대로 둔다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "\n**리터럴 허용 목록** (승격하지 않는다):\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1398 ;
    djr:text "\n- 사람 대상 서술 — 로그·예외 메시지·이메일 제목(열거가 아니라 문장, 비교 대상 아님)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1399 ;
    djr:text "- Enum·상수 **정의부 자체**의 우변(리터럴의 유일한 서식지)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1400, djr:R-1401, djr:R-1402, djr:R-1403 ;
    djr:text "- `Literal[...]`로 타입이 잠긴 인자 자리(`open(path, \"r\")` — 타입 체커가 오타를 잡는다). 단 **발행 이벤트 봉투의 discriminator 자리는 이 항목의 예외** — 거기는 domain enum 파생(`Literal[EventType.X]`)이 규율이고 맨 문자열 `Literal[\"…\"]`이면 위반(birth-enum — `architecture-ddd` §3.7). 버전 태그(`payload_schema_version`)는 같은 형태라도 리터럴 동결이 정답(짝 조항). **OHS published contract(`open_host_service/*/contract/`)의 discriminator 자리는 재예외** — contract 무의존(`discipline-houserules` §2 OHS 내부 구조)이 우선해 wire `Literal[\"…\"]`을 유지하고 union-enum 동기 테스트(`implementation-test` §15.5)가 드리프트를 방어한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.1 함수는 작게, 모듈은 깊게 [CC] [APoSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s029-3.2/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1415 ;
    djr:text "\n**함수 수준**: 함수를 만드는 첫째 규칙은 \"작게!\"이고, 둘째 규칙도 \"더 작게!\"이다. 의미 있는 이름으로 다른 함수를 추출할 수 있다면, 그 함수는 여러 작업을 하고 있다. **[CC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1416 ;
    djr:text "\n**모듈/클래스 수준**: 최고의 모듈은 단순한 인터페이스 뒤에 강력한(큰) 기능을 숨기는 \"깊은 모듈\"이다. 과도하게 작은 함수/클래스는 \"얕은 모듈\"이 되어 인터페이스가 구현만큼 복잡해질 수 있다. **[APoSD]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1417 ;
    djr:text "\n**통합 가이드라인**: 공개 인터페이스(모듈, 클래스)는 깊게 설계하되, 내부 구현은 작은 private 함수로 분해한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 하나의 함수가 너무 많은 일을 한다 ---\ndef render_page(page_data, is_suite):\n    is_test_page = page_data.has_attribute(\"Test\")\n    if is_test_page:\n        test_page = page_data.get_wiki_page()\n        new_content = \"\"\n        new_content += include_setup_pages(test_page, is_suite)\n        new_content += page_data.get_content()\n        new_content += include_teardown_pages(test_page, is_suite)\n        page_data.set_content(new_content)\n    return page_data.get_html()\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 작은 함수로 분해 (내부 구현) ---\ndef render_page(page_data, is_suite):\n    if is_test_page(page_data):\n        include_setup_and_teardown(page_data, is_suite)\n    return page_data.get_html()\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s028-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 얕은 모듈 -- 인터페이스가 구현만큼 복잡 ---\nclass FileReader:\n    def open(self, path: str) -> None: ...\n    def check_permissions(self, path: str) -> bool: ...\n    def read_bytes(self, offset: int, length: int) -> bytes: ...\n    def decode(self, data: bytes, encoding: str) -> str: ...\n    def close(self) -> None: ...\n\n# 사용하려면 호출자가 5단계를 전부 알아야 한다\nreader = FileReader()\nreader.open(\"data.txt\")\nif reader.check_permissions(\"data.txt\"):\n    raw = reader.read_bytes(0, 1024)\n    text = reader.decode(raw, \"utf-8\")\n    reader.close()\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 깊은 모듈 -- 단순한 인터페이스 뒤에 복잡성을 숨김 ---\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef read_text(path: str, encoding: str = \"utf-8\") -> str:\n    \"\"\"파일을 읽어 텍스트로 반환한다. 권한, 인코딩, 리소스 정리를 내부에서 처리.\"\"\"\n    return Path(path).read_text(encoding=encoding)\n\n# 호출자는 한 줄이면 된다\ntext = read_text(\"data.txt\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s029-3.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.2 한 가지만 해라 [CC] [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s029-3.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s029-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1418 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"함수는 한 가지를 해야 한다. 그 한 가지를 잘 해야 한다. 그 한 가지만을 해야 한다.\" **[CC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s029-3.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s029-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1419 ;
    djr:text "\n의미 있는 이름으로 다른 함수를 추출할 수 있다면, 그 함수는 여러 작업을 하고 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s030-3.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.3 추상화 수준은 하나로 [CC] [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s030-3.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s030-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1420 ;
    djr:text "\n한 함수 내의 모든 문장은 동일한 추상화 수준이어야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s030-3.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s030-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef compute(self):\n    self.input()\n    self.flags |= 0x0080  # 갑자기 추상화 수준이 바뀜\n    self.output()\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef compute(self):\n    self.input()\n    self.set_loaded_flag()  # 동일한 추상화 수준 유지\n    self.output()\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s031-3.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.4 함수 인수는 최소로 [CC] [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s031-3.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s031-3.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1421, djr:R-1422 ;
    djr:text "\n이상적인 인수 개수는 0개이다. 인수가 많으면 인수 객체를 만들어라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s031-3.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s031-3.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef make_circle(x: float, y: float, radius: float): ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef make_circle(center: Point, radius: float): ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s032-3.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.5 플래그 인수를 쓰지 마라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s032-3.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s032-3.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1423 ;
    djr:text "\n플래그 인수는 함수가 여러 가지 일을 한다고 대놓고 선언하는 것이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s032-3.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s032-3.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef render(is_suite: bool): ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef render_for_suite(): ...\ndef render_for_single_test(): ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s033-3.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.6 명령과 조회를 분리하라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s033-3.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s033-3.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1424 ;
    djr:text "\n함수는 무언가를 수행하거나 무언가에 답하거나 둘 중 하나만 해야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s033-3.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s033-3.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef set_attribute(name: str, value: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"속성을 설정하고 성공 여부를 반환\"\"\"\n    ...\n\nif set_attribute(\"username\", \"alice\"):  # 설정인가? 확인인가?\n    ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef attribute_exists(name: str) -> bool: ...\ndef set_attribute(name: str, value: str) -> None: ...\n\nif attribute_exists(\"username\"):\n    set_attribute(\"username\", \"alice\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s034-3.7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.7 부수 효과를 일으키지 마라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s034-3.7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s034-3.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1425 ;
    djr:text "\n부수 효과는 시간적 결합(temporal coupling)이나 순서 종속성을 초래한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s034-3.7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s034-3.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef check_password(username: str, password: str) -> bool:\n    user = find_user(username)\n    if user and verify(user.encoded_phrase, password):\n        session.initialize()  # 부수 효과! 이름에서 예측 불가\n        return True\n    return False\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef check_password(username: str, password: str) -> bool:\n    user = find_user(username)\n    if user is None:\n        return False\n    return verify(user.encoded_phrase, password)\n\ndef login(username: str, password: str) -> bool:\n    if check_password(username, password):\n        session.initialize()\n        return True\n    return False\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s035-3.8> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.8 대칭성을 활용하라 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.8" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s035-3.8/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s035-3.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1426 ;
    djr:text "\n코드의 대칭성을 찾아내서 명확히 표현하면 읽기 수월해진다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s035-3.8/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s035-3.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef compute(self):\n    self.input()\n    self.helper.process(self)  # 비대칭적\n    self.output()\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef compute(self):\n    self.input()\n    self.process()  # 대칭적 -- 모두 self에게 메시지\n    self.output()\n\ndef process(self):\n    self.helper.process(self)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s038> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### 루틴의 결정 횟수(Decision Count)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s038/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s038> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1427 ;
    djr:text "\n한 루틴의 결정 횟수가 **10을 초과**하면 재설계를 고려하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s038/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s038> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 결정 횟수 과다 ---\ndef process_order(order):\n    if order.status == \"new\":\n        if order.payment_method == \"credit\":\n            if order.amount > 1000:\n                if order.customer.is_vip:\n                    ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 전략 패턴 등으로 분해 ---\nclass OrderProcessor:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._status_handlers = {\n            \"new\": self._handle_new,\n            \"pending\": self._handle_pending,\n        }\n\n    def process(self, order):\n        handler = self._status_handlers.get(order.status)\n        if handler is None:\n            raise ValueError(f\"Unknown status: {order.status}\")\n        return handler(order)\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s038/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s038> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s039-4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 4. 주석과 문서화"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s039-4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s039-4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1428 ;
    djr:text "\n> **통합 원칙**: 구현 주석(인라인 주석)은 최소화하되, 인터페이스 주석(독스트링, 공개 API 문서)은 적극적으로 작성한다. **[CC] + [APoSD]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s040-4.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.1 구현 주석은 최소화하라 [CC] [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s040-4.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s040-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"주석은 코드로 의도를 표현하는 것에 실패했기 때문에 작성한다.\" **[CC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s040-4.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s040-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1429, djr:R-1430 ;
    djr:text "\n주석 대신 코드 자체로 의도를 표현해야 한다. 주석은 코드와 동기화가 깨지기 쉽고, 주석을 작성하고 일관성을 유지하는 비용을 정당화할 수 있는 경우에만 사용해야 한다. **[IP]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s040-4.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s040-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\n# 직원에게 복지 혜택을 받을 자격이 있는지 검사한다\nif employee.flags & HOURLY_FLAG and employee.age > 65:\n    ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nif employee.is_eligible_for_full_benefits():\n    ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.2 인터페이스 주석은 필수로 작성하라 [APoSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1431 ;
    djr:text "\nOusterhout은 \"좋은 코드는 주석이 필요 없다\"는 통념에 **반대**한다. 인터페이스 주석과 멤버 변수 주석은 짧게라도 반드시 작성해야 하며, 이는 복잡성을 줄이고 Unknown Unknowns를 방지하는 핵심 도구다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1432 ;
    djr:text "\n- **인터페이스 주석**: 모듈의 전체적 동작, 인자, 반환값, 부작용, 예외를 문서화하라\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1433 ;
    djr:text "- **구현 주석**: \"무엇\"이 아닌 \"왜\"를 설명하라\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1434 ;
    djr:text "- **멤버 변수 주석**: 변수의 목적을 짧게라도 반드시 설명하라\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s041-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 주석: 코드를 반복 (무엇) ---\ncount += 1  # count를 1 증가시킨다\n\n# --- 좋은 주석: 이유를 설명 (왜) ---\ncount += 1  # 재시도 횟수를 추적하여 최대 3회 초과 시 중단하기 위함\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s042-4.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.3 계층별 주석 가이드라인 요약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

