<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s045-4.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.6 문서화와 주석은 다르다 [PC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s045-4.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s045-4.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1440 ;
    djr:text "\n- **주석(comment)**: 가능한 한 적게. 코드 자체가 문서화되어야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s045-4.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s045-4.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1441 ;
    djr:text "- **문서(docstring)**: 컴포넌트의 동작 방식, 입출력 정보를 설명. \"이유가 아니라 설명\"이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s046-4.7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.7 독스트링 작성법"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s046-4.7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s046-4.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1442, djr:R-1443 ;
    djr:text "\n독스트링은 **무엇을** 문서화할지가 원칙이다 — 모듈/클래스/함수/스크립트의 동작·입출력·예외·호출 제약을 설명한다(§4.6). PEP 257 양식(삼중 따옴표, Args/Returns/Raises 구조)과 Python 작성 규칙은 `implementation-python` §26을 따른다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s046-4.7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s046-4.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s049-5.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.2 적절한 행 길이를 유지하라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s049-5.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s049-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n500줄이 넘지 않고 대부분 200줄 정도인 파일로도 커다란 시스템을 구축할 수 있다. **[CC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s049-5.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s049-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1444 ;
    djr:text "\n코드/주석의 구체적 줄 길이(line length) 수치는 Ruff 설정으로 강제하며 `implementation-python` §22를 따른다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s051-5.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.4 자동화 도구를 활용하라 [PC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s051-5.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s051-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1445, djr:R-1446 ;
    djr:text "\n포매팅, 린팅, 타입 검사를 자동화해야 한다. 이 모든 검사는 CI(지속적 통합)의 일부가 되어야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s051-5.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s051-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s054-6.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.2 구현이 아니라 인터페이스에 맞춰 코딩하라 [IP] [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s054-6.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s054-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1447 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"설계상의 결정을 필요 이상으로 노출하지 말라\" **[IP]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s054-6.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s054-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass ReportGenerator:\n    def generate(self, data: list):\n        mysql_conn = MySQLConnection()  # 구체적 구현에 의존\n        mysql_conn.save(data)\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass ReportGenerator:\n    def __init__(self, storage: StorageInterface):\n        self._storage = storage\n\n    def generate(self, data: list):\n        self._storage.save(data)  # 인터페이스에 의존\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s055-6.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.3 상태를 캡슐화하라 [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s055-6.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s055-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n객체의 자율성은 내부와 외부를 명확하게 구분하는 것으로부터 나온다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s055-6.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s055-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1448 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"객체가 무엇(what)을 수행하는지는 알 수 있지만 어떻게(how) 수행하는지에 대해서는 알 수 없어야 한다.\" **[OO]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s055-6.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s055-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass BankAccount:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.balance = 0  # 외부에서 직접 수정 가능\n\naccount = BankAccount()\naccount.balance = -1000  # 불변식 위반 가능\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass BankAccount:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._balance = 0\n\n    def deposit(self, amount: float) -> None:\n        if amount <= 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"입금액은 양수여야 합니다\")\n        self._balance += amount\n\n    def get_balance(self) -> float:\n        return self._balance\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s056-6.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.4 인터페이스와 구현의 분리 원칙 [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s056-6.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s056-6.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"객체를 구성하지만 공용 인터페이스에 포함되지 않는 모든 것이 구현에 포함된다.\" **[OO]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s056-6.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s056-6.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1449 ;
    djr:text "\n객체 설계의 핵심은 외부에 공개되는 인터페이스와 내부에 감춰지는 구현을 명확하게 분리하는 것이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s057-6.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.5 정보 은닉 (Information Hiding) [APoSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s057-6.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s057-6.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1450 ;
    djr:text "\n깊은 모듈을 달성하는 가장 중요한 기법이다. 설계 결정과 내부 정보를 인터페이스 뒤에 캡슐화하여 외부에 노출하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s057-6.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s057-6.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: Information Leakage (정보 누출) ---\n# 두 모듈이 같은 파일 형식 지식을 공유한다\nclass CSVReader:\n    def read(self, path: str) -> list[list[str]]:\n        with open(path) as f:\n            return [line.strip().split(\",\") for line in f]\n\nclass CSVWriter:\n    def write(self, path: str, rows: list[list[str]]) -> None:\n        with open(path, \"w\") as f:\n            for row in rows:\n                f.write(\",\".join(row) + \"\\n\")\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 형식 지식을 한 모듈에 집중 ---\nclass CSVFormat:\n    DELIMITER = \",\"\n    LINE_ENDING = \"\\n\"\n\n    @classmethod\n    def parse_row(cls, line: str) -> list[str]:\n        return line.strip().split(cls.DELIMITER)\n\n    @classmethod\n    def format_row(cls, fields: list[str]) -> str:\n        return cls.DELIMITER.join(fields) + cls.LINE_ENDING\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s057-6.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s057-6.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s063-8.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.1 행동이 상태를 결정한다 [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s063-8.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s063-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1451 ;
    djr:text "\n상태를 먼저 결정하고 행동을 나중에 결정하면 설계에 나쁜 영향을 끼친다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s063-8.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s063-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"어떤 객체가 어떤 타입에 속하는지를 결정하는 것은 객체가 수행하는 행동이다.\" **[OO]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s063-8.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s063-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 데이터 주도 설계 ---\nclass Employee:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.name = \"\"\n        self.salary = 0\n        self.department = \"\"\n    # 데이터를 먼저 정의하고 행동은 나중에...\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 책임 주도 설계 ---\nclass Employee:\n    def calculate_pay(self) -> Money: ...\n    def report_hours(self) -> Hours: ...\n    # 행동을 먼저 정의하고 필요한 데이터는 내부에 캡슐화\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s064-8.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.2 묻지 말고 시켜라 (Tell, Don't Ask) [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s064-8.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s064-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1452 ;
    djr:text "\n어떻게 해야 하는지 묻지 말고 무엇을 해야 하는지 요청하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s064-8.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s064-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 물어보고 직접 처리 ---\nif order.get_status() == \"paid\":\n    order.set_status(\"shipped\")\n    warehouse.remove_stock(order.get_items())\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 시키기 ---\norder.ship(warehouse)  # 주문 객체가 자율적으로 처리\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s065-8.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.3 조건문을 다형성으로 대체하라 [CC] [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s065-8.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s065-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1453 ;
    djr:text "\n중복되는 조건부 로직이나 분기문의 결과에 따라 로직이 달라지는 경우, 명시적인 조건문 대신 메시지(다형성)를 사용하는 것이 좋다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s065-8.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s065-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef calculate_pay(employee):\n    if employee.type == \"COMMISSIONED\":\n        return calculate_commissioned_pay(employee)\n    elif employee.type == \"HOURLY\":\n        return calculate_hourly_pay(employee)\n    elif employee.type == \"SALARIED\":\n        return calculate_salaried_pay(employee)\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass Employee:\n    def calculate_pay(self) -> Money:\n        raise NotImplementedError\n\nclass CommissionedEmployee(Employee):\n    def calculate_pay(self) -> Money: ...\n\nclass HourlyEmployee(Employee):\n    def calculate_pay(self) -> Money: ...\n\nclass SalariedEmployee(Employee):\n    def calculate_pay(self) -> Money: ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s066-8.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.4 위임으로 유연성 확보 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s066-8.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s066-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1454 ;
    djr:text "\n하위클래스는 정적(생성 시점 결정)이지만 위임은 런타임에 변경 가능하다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s066-8.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s066-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 조건문으로 도구 분기 ---\ndef mouse_down(self):\n    if self.get_tool() == \"SELECTING\":\n        ...\n    elif self.get_tool() == \"CREATING_RECTANGLE\":\n        ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 위임 ---\ndef mouse_down(self):\n    self.get_tool().mouse_down()  # 도구 객체에 위임\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s067-8.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.5 로직과 데이터를 함께 유지하라 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s067-8.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s067-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1455 ;
    djr:text "\n데이터와 그 데이터를 처리하는 로직을 밀접하게, 가급적 같은 메서드 혹은 같은 객체 내에 배치하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s067-8.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s067-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef format_address(street, city, state, zipcode):\n    return f\"{street}, {city}, {state} {zipcode}\"\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass Address:\n    def __init__(self, street, city, state, zipcode):\n        self.street = street\n        self.city = city\n        self.state = state\n        self.zipcode = zipcode\n\n    def format(self):\n        return f\"{self.street}, {self.city}, {self.state} {self.zipcode}\"\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s068-8.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.6 변화율에 따라 분리하라 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s068-8.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s068-8.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1456 ;
    djr:text "\n함께 변하는 로직과 데이터는 함께 관리하고, 변화율이 다른 것은 분리한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s068-8.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s068-8.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass Payment:\n    def __init__(self, value, currency):\n        self.value = value\n        self.currency = currency  # value와 currency는 항상 함께 변한다\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass Money:\n    def __init__(self, value, currency):\n        self.value = value\n        self.currency = currency\n\nclass Payment:\n    def __init__(self, amount: Money):\n        self.amount = amount  # 대칭적인 필드를 별도 객체로 분리\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s068-8.6/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s068-8.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s070-9.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.1 단일 책임 원칙 (SRP) [PC] [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s070-9.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s070-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1457 ;
    djr:text "\n클래스는 하나의 책임만 가져야 하며, 변경 이유도 단 하나여야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s070-9.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s070-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass SystemMonitor:\n    def load_activity(self): ...\n    def identify_events(self): ...\n    def stream_events(self): ...  # 세 가지 독립적 책임\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass ActivityLoader: ...\nclass EventIdentifier: ...\nclass EventStreamer: ...\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s070-9.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s070-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1458 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"만약 객체의 속성이나 메서드의 특성이 다른 클래스에서 발견되면 이들을 다른 곳으로 옮겨야 한다.\" **[PC]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### Django/dddjango 경계에서의 책임 분리"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1459 ;
    djr:text "\n웹 프레임워크 코드는 도메인 규칙, 입출력 변환, 저장소 접근, 렌더링, 권한/인증, 트랜잭션 경계가 한 함수나 클래스에 모이기 쉽다. 이때 파일 이름이나 계층 이름보다 **변경 이유**가 우선 판단 기준이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n| 스멜 | 증상 | 클린 코드 관점의 판단 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "|------|------|-----------------------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| **Fat Model** | Django model이 ORM 매핑, 도메인 상태 전이, 외부 알림, 결제/재고/권한 정책, 조회 포맷까지 모두 처리한다 | 데이터와 불변식을 가까이 두는 것은 좋지만, 외부 I/O나 유스케이스 흐름까지 model에 넣으면 변경 이유가 섞인다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1460 ;
    djr:text "| **Fat View / Fat Router** | view, Django Ninja router, DRF view가 요청 파싱 뒤 권한, 상태 전이, 계산, 저장, 알림, 응답 포맷을 긴 절차로 모두 수행한다 | framework entrypoint는 얇게 유지하고, 의도 있는 application/service 함수나 도메인 객체에 정책을 맡긴다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "| **Fat Schema / Serializer** | schema나 serializer가 validation을 넘어 주문 상태 변경, 가격 계산, DB 조회, 외부 호출을 수행한다 | 입출력 계약과 도메인 정책이 섞여 테스트와 재사용이 어려워진다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "| **Template business logic** | template tag, include, HTMX partial에서 권한/상태/가격 정책을 직접 계산한다 | 렌더링 관심사가 도메인 규칙을 숨기면 변경 누락과 중복이 커진다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1461 ;
    djr:text "| **Service dumping ground** | 모든 로직을 `services.py`로 옮겼지만 함수들이 서로 다른 정책과 I/O를 공유 전역처럼 사용한다 | 이름만 service인 얕은 모듈은 책임 분리가 아니다. 유스케이스, 도메인 규칙, 조회, 외부 연동의 변경 이유를 다시 나눠야 한다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s071> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1462 ;
    djr:text "\n다만 모든 Django model method가 Fat Model인 것은 아니다. 단일 엔티티의 불변식, 상태 질의, 표현 독립적인 작은 행위는 model이나 값 객체에 두는 편이 더 응집도 높을 수 있다. 반대로 transaction, locking, idempotency, aggregate 경계, REST contract, API error shape처럼 설계 결정이 먼저 필요한 문제는 클린 코드 스멜로만 처리하지 않고 DB/API/DDD 관련 기준으로 라우팅해야 한다(`architecture-db`·`architecture-api`·`architecture-ddd` 스킬).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s072-9.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.2 개방/폐쇄 원칙 (OCP) [PC] [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s072-9.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s072-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1463, djr:R-1464 ;
    djr:text "\n확장에는 개방되고 수정에는 폐쇄되어야 한다. 새로운 요구사항이 생기면 새로운 것을 추가만 할 뿐 기존 코드는 그대로 유지해야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s072-9.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s072-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass SystemMonitor:\n    def identify_event(self):\n        if self.event_data[\"before\"][\"session\"] == 0 and \\\n           self.event_data[\"after\"][\"session\"] == 1:\n            return LoginEvent(self.event_data)\n        # 새 이벤트마다 이 메서드를 수정해야 한다\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass Event:\n    @staticmethod\n    def meets_condition(event_data: dict) -> bool:\n        return False\n\nclass LoginEvent(Event):\n    @staticmethod\n    def meets_condition(event_data: dict) -> bool:\n        return (event_data[\"before\"][\"session\"] == 0\n                and event_data[\"after\"][\"session\"] == 1)\n\nclass SystemMonitor:\n    def identify_event(self):\n        for event_cls in Event.__subclasses__():\n            if event_cls.meets_condition(self.event_data):\n                return event_cls(self.event_data)\n        return UnknownEvent(self.event_data)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s073-9.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.3 리스코프 치환 원칙 (LSP) [PC] [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s073-9.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s073-9.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1465, djr:R-1466 ;
    djr:text "\n하위 클래스는 부모 클래스를 대체할 수 있어야 한다. 클라이언트는 사용하는 클래스의 계층 구조 변경에 대해 완전히 독립적이어야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s073-9.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s073-9.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: LSP 위반 ---\nclass Event:\n    def meets_condition(self, event_data: dict) -> bool:\n        return False\n\nclass LoginEvent(Event):\n    def meets_condition(self, event_data: list) -> bool:  # 파라미터 타입 변경!\n        return bool(event_data)\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass LoginEvent(Event):\n    def meets_condition(self, event_data: dict) -> bool:  # 부모와 동일한 서명\n        return event_data.get(\"after\", {}).get(\"session\") == 1\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s074-9.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.4 인터페이스 분리 원칙 (ISP) [PC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s074-9.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s074-9.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1467, djr:R-1468 ;
    djr:text "\n작은 인터페이스를 만들어라. 클라이언트가 필요하지 않은 메서드를 구현하도록 강제하지 마라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s074-9.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s074-9.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass EventParser:\n    def from_xml(self): ...\n    def from_json(self): ...  # 어떤 클래스는 둘 중 하나만 필요할 수 있다\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass XMLEventParser:\n    def from_xml(self): ...\n\nclass JSONEventParser:\n    def from_json(self): ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.5 의존성 역전 원칙 (DIP) [PC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1469, djr:R-1470 ;
    djr:text "\n구체적 구현이 아닌 추상화에 의존하라. 세부 사항은 추상화에 의존해야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass EventStreamer:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._target = Syslog()  # 구체 클래스에 직접 의존\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass EventStreamer:\n    def __init__(self, target: DataTargetClient):  # 인터페이스에 의존\n        self._target = target\n\n    def stream(self, events):\n        for event in events:\n            self._target.send(event.serialize())\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"일반적으로 구체적인 구현이 추상 컴포넌트보다 훨씬 더 자주 바뀔 것이다. 이런 이유로 추상화를 사용한다.\" **[PC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s075-9.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s078-10.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.2 추상 팩토리 (Abstract Factory) [GoF]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s078-10.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s078-10.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1471 ;
    djr:text "\n연관된 객체군을 구상 클래스 이름 없이 생성한다. 상속보다 구성(composition)을 선호하며, 제품군 전체를 일관되게 교체할 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s078-10.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s078-10.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 구상 클래스에 직접 의존 ---\nclass Application:\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.button = WindowsButton()  # OS 교체 시 전부 수정\n        self.checkbox = WindowsCheckbox()\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 추상 팩토리로 제품군 생성 ---\nfrom abc import ABC, abstractmethod\n\nclass Button(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    def render(self) -> str: ...\n\nclass Checkbox(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    def render(self) -> str: ...\n\nclass GUIFactory(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    def create_button(self) -> Button: ...\n    @abstractmethod\n    def create_checkbox(self) -> Checkbox: ...\n\nclass WindowsButton(Button):\n    def render(self) -> str:\n        return \"<win-btn/>\"\n\nclass WindowsCheckbox(Checkbox):\n    def render(self) -> str:\n        return \"<win-chk/>\"\n\nclass WindowsFactory(GUIFactory):\n    def create_button(self) -> Button:\n        return WindowsButton()\n    def create_checkbox(self) -> Checkbox:\n        return WindowsCheckbox()\n\nclass MacFactory(GUIFactory):\n    def create_button(self) -> Button:\n        return MacButton()\n    def create_checkbox(self) -> Checkbox:\n        return MacCheckbox()\n\n# 사용: 팩토리만 교체하면 제품군 전체가 바뀜\nclass Application:\n    def __init__(self, factory: GUIFactory) -> None:\n        self.button = factory.create_button()\n        self.checkbox = factory.create_checkbox()\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s080-10.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.4 널 객체 (Null Object) [Kent Beck]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s080-10.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s080-10.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1472 ;
    djr:text "\nNone 검사를 반복하는 대신, 아무 일도 하지 않는 객체를 사용한다. 다형성을 활용하여 조건문을 제거하고 코드 흐름을 단순화한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s080-10.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s080-10.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: None 검사가 곳곳에 산재 ---\nclass UserService:\n    def get_logger(self) -> Logger | None:\n        return self._logger\n\n    def process(self) -> None:\n        logger = self.get_logger()\n        if logger is not None:     # 매번 None 검사\n            logger.info(\"처리 시작\")\n        self._do_work()\n        if logger is not None:     # 또 None 검사\n            logger.info(\"처리 완료\")\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 널 객체로 None 검사 제거 ---\nclass NullLogger:\n    \"\"\"아무 일도 하지 않는 로거.\"\"\"\n    def info(self, msg: str) -> None:\n        pass\n\n    def error(self, msg: str) -> None:\n        pass\n\nclass UserService:\n    def __init__(self, logger: Logger | None = None) -> None:\n        self._logger = logger or NullLogger()\n\n    def process(self) -> None:\n        self._logger.info(\"처리 시작\")   # None 검사 불필요\n        self._do_work()\n        self._logger.info(\"처리 완료\")   # 항상 안전하게 호출\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.8 플러거블 객체 (Pluggable Object) [Kent Beck]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.8" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1473, djr:R-1474 ;
    djr:text "\n동일한 조건문이 두 번 이상 반복되면, 조건 분기를 객체로 대체한다. 조건을 생성 시점에 한 번만 결정하고 이후에는 다형성으로 해결한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 같은 조건문이 여러 곳에 반복 ---\nclass GraphEditor:\n    def __init__(self, mode: str) -> None:\n        self.mode = mode\n\n    def on_mouse_down(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        if self.mode == \"select\":\n            self._start_selection(x, y)\n        elif self.mode == \"draw\":\n            self._start_drawing(x, y)\n\n    def on_mouse_up(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        if self.mode == \"select\":        # 같은 조건 반복!\n            self._finish_selection(x, y)\n        elif self.mode == \"draw\":        # 같은 조건 반복!\n            self._finish_drawing(x, y)\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 플러거블 객체로 조건문 제거 ---\nfrom typing import Protocol\n\nclass Tool(Protocol):\n    def on_mouse_down(self, x: int, y: int) -> None: ...\n    def on_mouse_up(self, x: int, y: int) -> None: ...\n\nclass SelectionTool:\n    def on_mouse_down(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        print(f\"선택 시작: ({x}, {y})\")\n\n    def on_mouse_up(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        print(f\"선택 완료: ({x}, {y})\")\n\nclass DrawingTool:\n    def on_mouse_down(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        print(f\"그리기 시작: ({x}, {y})\")\n\n    def on_mouse_up(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        print(f\"그리기 완료: ({x}, {y})\")\n\nclass GraphEditor:\n    def __init__(self, tool: Tool) -> None:\n        self._tool = tool  # 조건을 생성 시점에 한 번만 결정\n\n    def on_mouse_down(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        self._tool.on_mouse_down(x, y)  # 조건문 없음\n\n    def on_mouse_up(self, x: int, y: int) -> None:\n        self._tool.on_mouse_up(x, y)    # 조건문 없음\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1475 ;
    djr:text "\n> Python 고유 구현 트릭(`__init_subclass__` 레지스트리 등)은 `implementation-python` 스킬을 참조한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s084-10.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s086-11.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.1 변수의 범위와 생명주기를 일치시켜라 [IP] [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s086-11.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s086-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1476, djr:R-1477 ;
    djr:text "\n변수의 범위와 생명기간은 가까운 것이 좋다. 같은 범위에서 정의된 변수들은 같은 생명기간을 갖는 것이 좋다. **[IP]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s086-11.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s086-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1478 ;
    djr:text "\n**변수의 \"생존 시간(live time)\"을 최소화**하라. 변수가 선언된 후 마지막으로 참조되기까지의 거리가 짧을수록 좋다. **[CodeC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s086-11.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s086-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nresult = None  # 훨씬 나중에 사용될 변수를 미리 선언\n# ... 100줄의 코드 ...\nresult = compute()\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\n# ... 100줄의 코드 ...\nresult = compute()  # 사용 직전에 선언\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s087-11.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.2 값 객체를 활용하라 [IP] [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s087-11.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s087-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1479, djr:R-1480 ;
    djr:text "\n변치 않는 값을 표현할 때는 값 객체를 사용하라. 생성 후 상태가 변경되지 않아야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s087-11.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s087-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 가변 상태 ---\nclass Transaction:\n    def __init__(self, value):\n        self.value = value  # 외부에서 변경 가능\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 값 객체 ---\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass Transaction:\n    value: int\n    credit_account: str\n    debit_account: str\n    # frozen=True로 불변 보장\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s088-11.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.3 상태 접근은 간접 접근을 기본으로 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s088-11.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s088-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1481 ;
    djr:text "\n내부에서는 직접 접근을 허용하되, 외부에서는 메서드를 통해 접근하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s088-11.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s088-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nclass Rectangle:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.width = 0\n        self.height = 0\n        self.area = 0  # width/height와 의존 관계인데 직접 접근\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\nclass Rectangle:\n    def __init__(self, width, height):\n        self._width = width\n        self._height = height\n\n    @property\n    def area(self):\n        return self._width * self._height\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.4 공용 상태 vs 가변 상태 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1482 ;
    djr:text "\n- **공용 상태**: 여러 연산에서 같은 데이터를 사용하는 경우 필드로 선언\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1483 ;
    djr:text "- **가변 상태**: 인스턴스마다 전혀 다른 데이터 요소가 필요한 경우에만 맵으로 표현\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1484 ;
    djr:text "- 가능하다면 공용 상태를 사용하는 것이 좋다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s089-11.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s090-12> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 12. 오류 처리"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s090-12/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s090-12> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1485, djr:R-1486, djr:R-1487 ;
    djr:text "\n> **통합 원칙**: 오류 처리는 두 단계로 접근한다. **1순위**: 오류 조건 자체를 설계에서 제거한다 **[APoSD]**. **2순위**: 설계로 제거할 수 없는 오류는 예외와 계약(DbC)으로 처리한다 **[CC] [PC]**.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s091-12.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.1 1순위: 오류를 존재에서 제거하라 [APoSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s091-12.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s091-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1488 ;
    djr:text "\n예외 처리는 소프트웨어 시스템에서 **가장 큰 복잡성 원천 중 하나**다. 가능하다면 오류 조건 자체를 설계적으로 제거하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s091-12.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s091-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 오류 조건이 불필요하게 존재 ---\nclass TextBuffer:\n    def delete_selection(self):\n        if not self.has_selection():\n            raise NoSelectionError(\"Nothing is selected\")\n        # ... 삭제 로직\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 오류를 존재에서 제거 ---\nclass TextBuffer:\n    def delete_selection(self):\n        \"\"\"현재 선택 영역을 삭제한다. 선택이 없으면 아무것도 하지 않는다.\"\"\"\n        if not self.has_selection():\n            return  # 예외 대신 정상 흐름으로 처리\n        # ... 삭제 로직\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s092-12.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.2 2순위: 오류 코드보다 예외를 사용하라 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s092-12.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s092-12.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1489, djr:R-1490, djr:R-1491 ;
    djr:text "\n> dddjango 경계 단서: «물건이 없다·이미 있다·규칙이 거절한다»는 예외가 아니라 «답»이다(#453·#454) — OHS 계약에서는 raise 대신 결과 분기를 쓰고, 조회 use case의 «없다»는 `None`이다. 유스케이스가 실패를 Result 값으로 돌려주는 방식은 쓰지 않는다(`<use_case>_result.py`엔 성공 한 벌만 — #571; 그 밖의 use case 실패는 예외다). 이 절의 raise 우선은 그 밖의 일반 오류 처리다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s092-12.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s092-12.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1492 ;
    djr:text "\n오류 코드를 반환하면 호출자는 오류 코드를 곧바로 처리해야 하고, 명령/조회 분리 규칙을 위반한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s092-12.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s092-12.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\nresult = delete_page(page)\nif result == E_OK:\n    result = registry.delete_reference(page.name)\n    if result == E_OK:\n        ...\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ntry:\n    delete_page_and_all_references(page)\nexcept PageDeletionError as error:\n    logger.error(error)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s093-12.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.3 Try/Catch 분리는 의도와 인지 경계를 따른다 [CC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s093-12.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s093-12.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1493, djr:R-1494 ;
    djr:text "\n정상 동작과 오류 처리 동작을 분리하면 이해하고 수정하기 쉬워진다. 이는 모든\n`catch`를 별도 함수로 추출하라는 절대 명령이 아니라, 정상 흐름과 오류 흐름의\n의도가 한 눈에 구분되게 하는 인지 경계 원칙이다. `try`에는 처리 대상의 최외곽\n호출만 두고, 실제로 처리할 수 있는 구체 예외만 잡는다(§12.7).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s093-12.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s093-12.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef delete(page):\n    try:\n        delete_page_and_all_references(page)\n    except PageDeletionError as error:\n        log_error(error)\n\ndef delete_page_and_all_references(page):\n    delete_page(page)\n    registry.delete_reference(page.name)\n    config_keys.delete_key(page.name.make_key())\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s093-12.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s093-12.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1495, djr:R-1496, djr:R-1497, djr:R-1498, djr:R-1499 ;
    djr:text "\n선택한 framework/profile이 adapter entrypoint에 예외→전송 응답 매핑의 소유권을\n명시적으로 부여한 경우에는, 그 entrypoint 안에 작은 구체 `catch`와 준비된 오류\n응답의 직접 반환을 유지할 수 있다. 예를 들어 Django Ninja controller operation이\nknown application/domain exception을 잡아 준비된 concrete `ErrorSchema`를\n`Status(<승인된 HTTP status 표현>, error)`로 직접 반환하는 규율은\n`implementation-django-ninja` §6.2를 따른다. 이때 분리 원칙을 맞추기 위해서만\nmapping helper/factory/handler를 추출하지 않는다. 단, 이 자격은 광범위 catch를\n허용하지 않으며, `try` 범위를 넓히거나 정상/오류 흐름을 뒤섞는 근거가 되지 않는다.\nresource cleanup, transaction, retry, 예외 추상화의 소유와 규율도 각각 그대로 따른다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s094-12.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.4 올바른 추상화 수준에서 예외를 처리하라 [PC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s094-12.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s094-12.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1500, djr:R-1501 ;
    djr:text "\n예외는 함수가 캡슐화하고 있는 로직에 대한 것이어야 한다. 서로 다른 수준의 추상화를 혼합하지 마라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s095-12.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.5 보호절(Guard Clause)을 활용하라 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s095-12.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s095-12.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1502 ;
    djr:text "\n주요 흐름과 예외 흐름의 차이를 부각시켜라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s095-12.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s095-12.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예 ---\ndef compute():\n    server = get_server()\n    if server is not None:\n        client = server.get_client()\n        if client is not None:\n            request = client.get_request()\n            if request is not None:\n                process_request(request)\n\n# --- 좋은 예 ---\ndef compute():\n    server = get_server()\n    if server is None: return\n    client = server.get_client()\n    if client is None: return\n    request = client.get_request()\n    if request is None: return\n    process_request(request)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s096-12.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.6 계약에 의한 디자인 (DbC) [PC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s096-12.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s096-12.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1503 ;
    djr:text "\n사전조건과 사후조건을 명시적으로 정의하여 책임 소재를 명확히 하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s096-12.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s096-12.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\ndef add_positive_numbers(a: float, b: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"양수 두 개를 더한다.\"\"\"\n    if a <= 0 or b <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"입력 값은 양수여야 합니다\")  # 사전 조건\n\n    result = a + b\n\n    assert result > 0, \"결과 값은 양수여야 합니다\"  # 사후 조건\n    return result\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s097-12.7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.7 방어적 프로그래밍 [CodeC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s097-12.7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s097-12.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1504, djr:R-1505, djr:R-1506, djr:R-1507 ;
    djr:text "\n잘못된 입력으로부터 프로그램을 보호하라. \"외부\"를 어디로 정할지 결정하고, 그 경계에서 데이터를 검증하라. 예외는 구체적으로 잡는다 — 모든 예외를 무차별로 삼키면(bare/광범위 catch) 버그가 가려지므로, 실제로 처리할 수 있는 구체적 예외 유형만 명시한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### 단언(Assertion) vs 오류 처리"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n| 상황 | 기법 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
