    djr:text "|------|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1508 ;
    djr:text "| 절대 발생해서는 안 되는 조건 | `assert` 사용 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1509 ;
    djr:text "| 발생할 수 있는 예상된 조건 | 오류 처리 코드 사용 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1510 ;
    djr:text "| 고신뢰성이 필요한 코드 | 둘 다 사용 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s098> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# Assertion: 개발 중 논리 오류 탐지\ndef calculate_discount(price: float, rate: float) -> float:\n    assert 0.0 <= rate <= 1.0, f\"Discount rate must be 0-1, got {rate}\"\n    assert price >= 0, f\"Price must be non-negative, got {price}\"\n    return price * (1 - rate)\n\n# 오류 처리: 외부 입력 검증\ndef parse_user_input(raw_rate: str) -> float:\n    try:\n        rate = float(raw_rate)\n    except ValueError:\n        raise InvalidInputError(f\"'{raw_rate}' is not a valid number\")\n    if not 0.0 <= rate <= 1.0:\n        raise InvalidInputError(f\"Rate must be between 0 and 1, got {rate}\")\n    return rate\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.1 DRY는 지식의 중복을 금지하는 것이다 [PP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1511 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"모든 지식은 시스템 안에서 단일하고 모호하지 않은 권위 있는 표현을 가져야 한다.\" **[PP]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1512, djr:R-1513, djr:R-1514 ;
    djr:text "\nDRY는 단순한 코드 중복 금지가 아니다. **지식의 중복**을 금지하는 것이다. 같은 코드라도 서로 다른 지식을 표현한다면 중복이 아닐 수 있고, 다른 코드라도 같은 지식을 표현한다면 DRY 위반이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# DRY 위반: 같은 검증 지식이 두 곳에\nclass UserValidator:\n    def validate_age(self, age: int) -> bool:\n        return 0 < age < 150\n\nclass UserForm:\n    def is_valid_age(self, age: int) -> bool:\n        return age > 0 and age < 150  # 같은 규칙의 다른 표현\n\n# DRY 준수: 검증 규칙의 단일 소스\nclass AgePolicy:\n    MIN_AGE = 0\n    MAX_AGE = 150\n\n    @classmethod\n    def is_valid(cls, age: int) -> bool:\n        return cls.MIN_AGE < age < cls.MAX_AGE\n\nclass UserValidator:\n    def validate_age(self, age: int) -> bool:\n        return AgePolicy.is_valid(age)\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s101-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# DRY가 아닌 경우: 우연히 같은 코드지만 다른 지식\ndef validate_user_age(age: int) -> bool:\n    return 0 < age < 150  # 사용자 나이 정책\n\ndef validate_building_floors(floors: int) -> bool:\n    return 0 < floors < 150  # 건물 층수 제한 -- 우연히 같은 범위\n\n# 이 두 함수를 합치면 안 된다. 서로 다른 도메인 지식을 표현한다.\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s103-13.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.3 지역적 변화의 원칙 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s103-13.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s103-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1515 ;
    djr:text "\n코드를 수정할 때 함께 바꿔야 하는 부분을 최소화하라. 중복을 없애는 방법은 프로그램을 여러 작은 부분으로 나누는 것이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s103-13.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s103-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s106-14.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.2 메시지가 인터페이스를 결정한다 [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s106-14.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s106-14.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1516 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"객체가 메시지를 선택하는 것이 아니라 메시지가 객체를 선택하게 해야 한다.\" **[OO]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s106-14.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s106-14.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1517 ;
    djr:text "\n어떤 행위(메시지)가 필요한지 먼저 결정한 후에, 이 행위를 수행할 객체를 결정하라 (What/Who 사이클).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s107-14.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.3 응집력과 결합력 [PC] [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s107-14.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s107-14.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1518 ;
    djr:text "\n- **응집력(Cohesion)**: 높을수록 좋다. 작고 잘 정의된 목적을 가진 모듈\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s107-14.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s107-14.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1519 ;
    djr:text "- **결합력(Coupling)**: 낮을수록 좋다. 객체 간 의존성 최소화\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s107-14.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s107-14.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 높은 결합력 ---\nclass Order:\n    def process(self):\n        db = MySQLDatabase()  # 구체 클래스에 직접 의존\n        db.save(self.data)\n        email = SMTPEmailSender()  # 또 다른 구체 클래스에 직접 의존\n        email.send(self.confirmation)\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 낮은 결합력 ---\nclass Order:\n    def __init__(self, repository: Repository, notifier: Notifier):\n        self._repository = repository\n        self._notifier = notifier\n\n    def process(self):\n        self._repository.save(self.data)\n        self._notifier.send(self.confirmation)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.4 상속보다 합성을 우선하라 [IP] [PC] [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1520 ;
    djr:text "\n상속의 단점:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 되돌리기 어렵다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- 하위 클래스는 상위 클래스에 강하게 결합된다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- 동적으로 변화하는 로직을 나타낼 수 없다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1521 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"단지 부모 클래스에 있는 메서드를 공짜로 얻을 수 있기 때문에 상속을 하는 것은 좋지 않다.\" **[PC]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s108-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 재사용만을 위한 상속 ---\nclass TransactionPolicy(collections.UserList):\n    \"\"\"리스트의 모든 메서드가 노출됨 -- 필요하지 않은 것까지\"\"\"\n    pass\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 합성 ---\nclass TransactionPolicy:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._transactions = []\n\n    def add(self, transaction):\n        self._transactions.append(transaction)\n\n    def __len__(self):\n        return len(self._transactions)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s109-14.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.5 직교성 (Orthogonality) [PP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s109-14.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s109-14.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1522 ;
    djr:text "\n두 가지 이상의 것이 직교적이면, 하나의 변경이 다른 것에 영향을 주지 않는다. 관련 없는 것들 사이의 영향을 제거하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s109-14.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s109-14.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 직교성 위반 -- UI 로직과 비즈니스 로직이 결합 ---\nclass ReportGenerator:\n    def generate(self, data: list[dict]) -> str:\n        html = \"<html><body>\"\n        total = sum(item[\"amount\"] for item in data)\n        tax = total * 0.1  # 비즈니스 로직\n        html += f\"<h1>Total: {total}</h1>\"  # UI 로직\n        html += f\"<p>Tax: {tax}</p>\"\n        html += \"</body></html>\"\n        return html\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 직교적 분리 ---\nclass TaxCalculator:\n    RATE = 0.1\n    def calculate(self, amount: float) -> float:\n        return amount * self.RATE\n\nclass ReportData:\n    def __init__(self, items: list[dict]):\n        self.total = sum(item[\"amount\"] for item in items)\n        self.tax = TaxCalculator().calculate(self.total)\n\nclass HTMLReportRenderer:\n    def render(self, report: ReportData) -> str:\n        return (\n            f\"<html><body>\"\n            f\"<h1>Total: {report.total}</h1>\"\n            f\"<p>Tax: {report.tax}</p>\"\n            f\"</body></html>\"\n        )\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s110-14.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.6 가역성 (Reversibility) [PP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s110-14.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s110-14.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1523, djr:R-1524 ;
    djr:text "\n되돌리기 어려운 결정을 피하라. 추상화를 통해 핵심 결정을 교체 가능하게 만들라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s110-14.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s110-14.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# --- 나쁜 예: 특정 DB에 직접 결합 ---\nimport psycopg2\n\nclass UserRepository:\n    def find(self, user_id: int):\n        conn = psycopg2.connect(...)\n        cursor = conn.cursor()\n        cursor.execute(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = %s\", (user_id,))\n        return cursor.fetchone()\n\n# --- 좋은 예: 추상화로 결정을 가역적으로 만듬 ---\nfrom typing import Protocol\n\nclass UserRepository(Protocol):\n    def find(self, user_id: int) -> User | None: ...\n\nclass PostgresUserRepository:\n    def find(self, user_id: int) -> User | None: ...\n\nclass MongoUserRepository:\n    def find(self, user_id: int) -> User | None: ...\n\n# DB를 바꿔도 UserRepository를 사용하는 코드는 변경 불필요\n```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s110-14.6/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s110-14.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s127-16.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.3 Sprout Method (발아 메서드) [WELC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s127-16.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s127-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1525 ;
    djr:text "\n새 기능을 추가할 때, 기존 코드를 수정하지 않고 **새 메서드로 작성**한 후 기존 코드에서 호출한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s127-16.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s127-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 기존 레거시 코드 (테스트 없음, 수정하기 위험)\nclass TransactionGate:\n    def post_entries(self, entries: list) -> None:\n        for entry in entries:\n            entry.post_date = datetime.now()\n            self._verify_entry(entry)\n            self._persist(entry)\n\n# 새 요구사항: 중복 항목 필터링 추가\n# Sprout Method: 새 기능을 별도 메서드로 작성 (테스트 가능)\nclass TransactionGate:\n    def post_entries(self, entries: list) -> None:\n        unique_entries = self._remove_duplicates(entries)  # 새 메서드 호출\n        for entry in unique_entries:\n            entry.post_date = datetime.now()\n            self._verify_entry(entry)\n            self._persist(entry)\n\n    def _remove_duplicates(self, entries: list) -> list:\n        \"\"\"중복 항목을 제거한다. (새 메서드 -- 단위 테스트 작성 가능)\"\"\"\n        seen = set()\n        unique = []\n        for entry in entries:\n            if entry.id not in seen:\n                seen.add(entry.id)\n                unique.append(entry)\n        return unique\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s128-16.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.4 Wrap Method (감싸기 메서드) [WELC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s128-16.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s128-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1526 ;
    djr:text "\n기존 메서드를 래핑하여 전후에 새 동작을 추가한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s128-16.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s128-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# Wrap Method: 기존 메서드를 감싸서 로깅 추가\nclass Employee:\n    def pay(self) -> None:\n        self._log_payment()       # 새 동작 (전)\n        self._dispatch_pay()      # 기존 로직 (이름 변경)\n        self._update_records()    # 새 동작 (후)\n\n    def _dispatch_pay(self) -> None:\n        # 원래 pay()의 로직 (이름만 변경)\n        ...\n\n    def _log_payment(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"급여 지급 로깅 (새 메서드 -- 테스트 가능)\"\"\"\n        ...\n\n    def _update_records(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"급여 기록 업데이트 (새 메서드 -- 테스트 가능)\"\"\"\n        ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s129-16.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.5 특성화 테스트 (Characterization Tests) [WELC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s129-16.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s129-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1527 ;
    djr:text "\n레거시 구현을 이해하기 위해 “올바른 동작”이 아니라 **현재 동작을 포착**하는 임시 probe다. 현재 구현은 계약의 증거일 뿐 오라클이 아니므로, 특성화 결과를 영구 회귀 테스트나 구현 완료 증거로 곧바로 고정하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s129-16.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s129-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1528, djr:R-1529, djr:R-1530, djr:R-1531 ;
    djr:text "\n특성화 probe는 **non-migration 레거시 코드**에만 쓴다. migration 파일·과거 model state·forward/reverse를 관찰하는 임시 테스트는 “조사용”이라는 이름으로 migration 전용 테스트 금지를 우회하므로 작성하지 않는다. 현재 승인 계약을 확인한 뒤 probe를 계약 테스트로 다시 쓰거나 제거한다. 유지·갱신·분리·삭제 판정은 `discipline-tdd` §5.5가 소유한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s129-16.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s129-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\ndef test_legacy_calculate_tax():\n    \"\"\"계약 확인 전 레거시 동작을 조사하는 임시 probe.\"\"\"\n    assert legacy_calculate_tax(1000) == 103.5\n    assert legacy_calculate_tax(0) == 0\n    assert legacy_calculate_tax(-500) == -51.75  # 음수 입력에 대한 현재 동작\n\n    # 계약 확인 뒤 현행 계약 테스트로 재작성하거나 제거한다\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.6 Sensing과 Separation [WELC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n- **Sensing (감지)**: 코드가 계산하는 값에 접근하여 시스템의 다른 부분에 미치는 영향을 파악\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- **Separation (분리)**: 테스트를 위해 코드를 의존성에서 분리\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1532 ;
    djr:text "\n레거시 코드에서 테스트가 어려운 주요 원인은 **얽힌 의존성** 때문이다. Seam을 찾아 의존성을 끊고, 감지와 분리를 통해 테스트 가능한 코드로 전환한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s130-16.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.1 설계 단계에서 두 번 설계하고, 구현 단계에서 빠르게 다듬어라 [APoSD] [CC] [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1533 ;
    djr:text "\n> **통합 원칙**: 주요 아키텍처/인터페이스 결정은 최소 두 가지 근본적으로 다른 접근법을 비교한다 **[APoSD]**. 세부 구현은 빠르게 작성한 후 테스트를 유지하며 반복적으로 리팩토링한다 **[CC] [OO]**.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1538 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"설계를 간단히 끝내고 최대한 빨리 구현에 돌입하라. 머릿속에 객체의 협력 구조가 번뜩인다면 그대로 코드를 구현하기 시작하라.\" **[OO]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n**설계 단계 (Design It Twice)** [APoSD]:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1534 ;
    djr:text "- 모든 주요 설계 결정에 대해 최소 **두 가지 근본적으로 다른 접근법**을 고려하라\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- 첫 번째 생각이 최선의 설계를 내놓을 가능성은 낮다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "- 전술적 프로그래밍(\"일단 동작하면 된다\")은 복잡성을 누적시키고 장기적으로 기능 추가 비용을 증가시킨다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "\n**구현 단계 (빠르게 구현 후 리팩토링)** [CC] [OO]:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1535 ;
    djr:text "1. 처음에는 길고 복잡해도 좋다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1536 ;
    djr:text "2. 다듬고 또 다듬는다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s132-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1537 ;
    djr:text "3. 다듬는 와중에도 항상 단위 테스트는 통과한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s133-17.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.2 안정적인 구조 중심 설계 [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s133-17.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s133-17.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1539 ;
    djr:text "\n기능을 중심으로 구조를 종속시키면 변경에 취약하다.\n안정적인 구조(도메인 모델)를 중심으로 기능을 종속시켜야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s133-17.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s133-17.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"도메인 모델이 안정적인 이유는 사용자가 도메인의 본질적인 측면을 가장 잘 이해하고 있기 때문이다.\" **[OO]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.3 책임 주도 설계 (RDD) [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1540 ;
    djr:text "\n1. 시스템이 사용자에게 제공해야 하는 기능인 시스템 책임을 파악한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1541 ;
    djr:text "2. 시스템 책임을 더 작은 책임으로 분할한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1542 ;
    djr:text "3. 분할된 책임을 수행할 적절한 객체에 할당한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s134-17.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1543 ;
    djr:text "4. 객체가 다른 객체의 도움이 필요하면 협력을 설계한다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.4 세 가지 관점으로 클래스를 바라보라 [OO]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n- **개념적 관점**: 도메인 안의 개념과 관계를 반영\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- **명세 관점**: 객체가 협력을 위해 \"무엇\"을 할 수 있는가 (인터페이스)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- **구현 관점**: 객체의 책임을 \"어떻게\" 수행할 것인가\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s135-17.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1544 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"구현이 아니라 인터페이스에 대해 프로그래밍하라.\" -- GoF **[OO]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s136-17.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.5 YAGNI [PC]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s136-17.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s136-17.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1545 ;
    djr:text "\n유지보수 가능한 소프트웨어를 만드는 것은 미래의 요구사항을 예측하는 것이 아니다. 현재 요구사항을 잘 해결하고, 나중에 수정하기 쉽도록 작성하는 것이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s137-17.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.6 패턴은 절대적 진리가 아니다 [IP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s137-17.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s137-17.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1546 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"패턴은 절대적인 진리가 아니므로 상황에 따라 패턴을 적절히 변화시켜 사용해야 한다.\" **[IP]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s137-17.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s137-17.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1547 ;
    djr:text "\n특정 상황에서 특정 패턴을 왜 쓰는지를 알아야 한다. 원칙을 명확하게 알고 있다면 새로운 패턴을 만들 수도 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s138-17.7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.7 깨진 창문 이론 [PP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s138-17.7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s138-17.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1548, djr:R-1549 ;
    djr:text "\n하나의 깨진 창문(나쁜 설계, 잘못된 결정, 나쁜 코드)을 방치하면, 전체 소프트웨어가 빠르게 퇴화한다. **발견 즉시 수리하라.** 시간이 없다면 최소한 \"판자로 막아 놓으라\" (TODO 주석, 예외 발생 등).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s138-17.7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s138-17.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 깨진 창문: 방치된 나쁜 코드\ndef calc(d):\n    x = d.get(\"v\")\n    if x:\n        return x * 1.1\n    return 0\n\n# 수리된 창문\nTAX_RATE = 0.1\n\ndef calculate_total_with_tax(order_data: dict) -> float:\n    \"\"\"주문 데이터에서 세금 포함 총액을 계산한다.\"\"\"\n    amount = order_data.get(\"amount\")\n    if amount is None:\n        raise ValueError(\"Order data must contain 'amount'\")\n    return amount * (1 + TAX_RATE)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.9 기타 핵심 팁 [PP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.9" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9/b1> a djr:Block ;
