    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| ETC (Easier to Change) | 좋은 설계의 핵심 가치 -- 변경하기 쉬운 코드 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1550 ;
    djr:text "| 작은 걸음으로 (Take Small Steps) | 항상 작은 단위로 변경하고 확인하라 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1551 ;
    djr:text "| 일찍 리팩토링하고 자주 리팩토링하라 | 문제를 발견하면 즉시 개선 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1552 ;
    djr:text "| 최소 결합의 법칙 | 물어보지 말고 말하라 (Tell, Don't Ask) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s140-17.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1553 ;
    djr:text "| 우연에 의한 프로그래밍을 피하라 | 코드가 왜 동작하는지 항상 이해하라 |\n" .

